# The fixtures are hashed byte for byte in each MANIFEST.json, so git must not
# rewrite their line endings on checkout or commit. Without this, a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true) would produce different bytes than the Linux one
# the hashes were taken on, and the manifest check would fail for a reason that
# has nothing to do with the netlists.
*.v  -text
*.vo -text
